// fit(features, labels, p):
// 1. for each class c with |c| > N/C · (1 + max(2p, 0.08)):
// 2.   $\mu_c$ = mean; $v_c$ = top right SV of (X_c − $\mu_c$); proj = (X_c − $\mu_c$) v_c
// 3.   poison-side ← side with larger |mean(proj)|; tiebreak by global-mean side, then smaller-group, then lower-variance
// 4.   store sep_c = Cohen's d(pos, neg) on proj
// score(features, logits):
// 5. for each cached target class c:
// 6.   feat_score = proj_f² on poison-side (else 0)
// 7.   recompute logits-PCA on the fly → logit_score similarly
// 8.   $w_f$ = sep_f/(sep_f+sep_l), $w_l$ = sep_l/(sep_f+sep_l)
// 9.   score = $w_f$·feat/maxfeat + $w_l$·logit/maxlogit (zero on non-target classes)

// fit(features, labels, p):
// 1. for each class c (|c| ≥ 4):
// 2.   pass-1: $\mu_1$ = median; $v_1$ = top SV of X_c − $\mu_1$; proj₁ = |(X_c−$\mu_1$) v_1|
// 3.   drop top 30% by proj₁ to obtain a clean subset
// 4.   pass-2: $\mu_2$ = median(clean), $v_2$ = top SV of clean − $\mu_2$
// 5.   store ($\mu_2$, $v_2$)
// score(features, logits):
// 6. spectral_i = ((x_i − $\mu_2$)·$v_2$)²  (per cached training label)
// 7. conf_i = (max-prob_i − median(class)) / MAD(class)  using predicted class
// 8. per-class min-max normalise both; final = norm(spectral) + norm(conf)

// score(features, logits):
// 1. for each class c with |c| ≥ 4:
// 2.   $\mu_c$ = mean; $v_c$ = top SV of (X_c − $\mu_c$); proj = (X_c − $\mu_c$) v_c
// 3.   1-D k-means(proj, k=2) initialised at min/max → 2 clusters {A, B}
// 4.   loss_A = median(NLL_A), loss_B = median(NLL_B)
// 5.   if loss_B < loss_A: signed = proj  (B is loss-poor → poison side)
// 6.   elif loss_A < loss_B: signed = −proj
// 7.   else: signed = ±proj by smaller side
// 8.   amp = (|c| / max_c |c|)¹⁰  (zeros out clean classes)
// 9.   score(c) = signed · |signed| · amp
// (no fit work; cached labels used to pick samples per class)

// fit:
// 1. standardise features (global μ, σ)
// 2. for each class c:
// 3.   $v_c$ = top right SV of (X_c − $\bar X_c$);  init1d = 1-D k-means on (X_c − $\bar X_c$)·$v_c$
// 4.   labels_c = full 2-means(X_c, init1d);  major→clean, minor→suspect prototypes
// 5.   anomaly_c = (|c|−median|·|)/median + 0.15·gap + 0.05·anisotropy + 0.10·|pos_mass − 0.5|
// 6. gates = 0.02 everywhere except largest-anomaly class → 1.0
// score:
// 7. for each class c with cached label = c:
// 8.   d_clean, d_suspect → affinity = d_clean − d_suspect (rank-normalised)
// 9.   axis = ((x − clean)·sep_dir) / √proj_var (rank);  far_rank = rank(d_clean);  conf_rank = rank(p[label])
// 10.   fused = 0.50·affinity + 0.25·axis + 0.15·far + 0.10·conf
// 11.   score = 0.60·gate + gate·fused + 0.02·axis + 0.01·far

// fit:
// 1. for each class c (|c| ≥ 5):
// 2.   $\mu_c$ = geometric-median (Weiszfeld, 40 iters);  $v_c$ = top SV of X_c − $\mu_c$
// 3.   proj = (X_c − $\mu_c$) v_c;  scale_c = MAD(proj)
// 4. global SV: $v_g$ = top SV of (X − mean(X))
// score(features, logits):
// 5. spectral_i = ((x_i − $\mu_{c(i)}$)·$v_{c(i)}$ / scale_{c(i)})²  (per training label)
// 6. global_i = ((x_i − mean)·$v_g$ / max|·|)²
// 7. conf_i = max softmax;  normalise spectral, global, conf to [0, 1]
// 8. coupled = norm(spectral_n × conf_n)
// 9. final = 0.7·max(coupled, spectral_n) + 0.3·global_n
